    <panel_attributes>*HartleyTransform&lt;T&gt;*
«T = float | double, move-only»
--
-dims: array&lt;size_t, 3&gt;  — Width, Height, Depth
-mode: Modes
-bitReversedIndices[3], twiddles[3]  — CPU tables
-impl: unique_ptr&lt;Impl&gt;  — GPU state (pimpl)
--
+HartleyTransform(width, height, depth, mode)
+ForwardTransform(data: T*)  — unnormalised
+InverseTransform(data: T*)  — forward, then × 1÷N
+ForwardSeparable(data: T*)  — no Bracewell pass, CPU
+ForwardTransform(volume: DeviceVolume&lt;T&gt;&amp;)
+InverseTransform(volume: DeviceVolume&lt;T&gt;&amp;)
+Width(), Height(), Depth(), Length(dir)
+LinearIndex(i, j, k), AxisIndex(...)
--
«private, defined in backend_cpu.cpp»
-FDHT1D, FDHT2D, FDHT3D, Series1D, RealFFT1D
-BracewellTransform2DCPU, BracewellTransform3DCPU
-BitReverse, BuildTwiddleTable
«private, defined in backend_cuda.cpp»
-DHT1DCuda, DHT2DCuda, DHT3DCuda  — host data
-DHT1DOnDevice, DHT2DOnDevice, DHT3DOnDevice
-TransformOnDevice(inOut, scratch)
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>520</x>
      <y>70</y>
