    <panel_attributes>*EvenKernelConvolution&lt;T&gt;*
«convolution.h — kernel even along every axis»
--
-width, height, depth, size
-transform: HartleyTransform&lt;T&gt;
-spectrum: vector&lt;T&gt;  — S(g) × 1÷N
--
+EvenKernelConvolution(w, h, d, mode = CPU)
+SetKernel(kernel, tol = 1e-6)  — checks evenness
+Apply(data: T*)  — f ← S( S(f) · S(g) ÷ N )
--
«free function»
+IsEvenPerAxis(kernel, w, h, d, tol): bool
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
