    <panel_attributes>«source» transform.cpp
--
constructor: CPU tables, or GPU matrices + scratch
ForwardTransform: dispatch by Modes and 1D, 2D, 3D
InverseTransform: forward, then × 1÷N
RejectMultiProcess: more than one MPI rank throws
resident overloads → TransformOnDevice
