      <w>410</w>
      <h>140</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>«source» backend_cpu.cpp  [OpenMP]
--
FDHT1D: radix-2 FHT along one axis
Series1D: FDHT1D over every line of an axis
FDHT2D, FDHT3D: Series1D per axis + Bracewell
ForwardSeparable: Series1D per axis only
RealFFT1D: reference path for Modes::RFFT
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>510</x>
      <y>1310</y>
      <w>370</w>
      <h>180</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>«source» backend_cuda.cpp  [cuBLAS]
«compiled only with RAPIDHT_WITH_CUDA»
--
DHTnDCuda: upload → DHTnDOnDevice → download
DHT3DOnDevice, no transposes:
  X:  C_W · [W × HD]          one GEMM
  Y:  [W × H] · C_H           D batches
  Z:  [WH × D] · C_D          one GEMM
  then BracewellTransform3D kernel
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
